{"title":"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_22\">Problem 22</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 22\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/0/4f094de8857c778f46258a9f704767aea7bca19b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2x^2-x}{(x+1)(x-2)}-\\frac{4+x}{(x+1)(x-2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"252\" height=\"43\" /> cannot be evaluated for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c2e8c17cff668023b2f29f2e95e4a0fafa6271.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/2/69271b422e022ea65ff1f288eddfcfa82afd8ab7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, \nsince division by zero is not allowed. For other values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/8/0a863454a2374035f0d54937fe4064890ab6fcf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{The expression takes on many different values.}\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{The expression has only the value 2.}\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{The expression has only the value 1.}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{The expression always has a value between }-1\\text{ and }+2.\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{The expression has a value greater than 2 or less than }-1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"467\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/5/db572b072b46886ddf2e6a103c729cf200482b85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2x^2-x}{(x+1)(x-2)}-\\frac{4+x}{(x+1)(x-2)} = \\frac{2x^2-2x-4}{(x+1)(x-2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"392\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>This can be factored as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/467abb665b3f42742989db0e7ee071360c9f71ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2)(x^2-x-2)}{(x+1)(x-2)} \\implies \\frac{(2)(x+1)(x-2)}{(x+1)(x-2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"309\" height=\"43\" />, which cancels out to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/d/f7d55e0174365962ed703b63eaced4576536c08a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\text{The expression has only the value 2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"358\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME\" title=\"1954 AHSME\">1954 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1954 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1954\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1954_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1954 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a><